OL,3,GNEWSAChippy owner honoured with
OL,4,Apainting by royal artist
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fish and chip shop owner has been
OL,7,Fimmortalised by a royal portrait artist
OL,8,Fas part of an exhibition to honour the
OL,9,Fimpact independent businesses have on
OL,10,Ftheir communities.
OL,12,FPindy Kaur has been depicted by artist
OL,13,FNicky Philipps, who has previously
OL,14,Fpainted members of the Royal Family,
OL,15,Fincluding the late Queen Elizabeth II
OL,16,Fin 2013, 2016 and 2018.
OL,18,FKaur, who runs Monk Bretton's Ocean
OL,19,FFish Bar, in Barnsley, said: "To have
OL,20,Fme painted by someone that's painted
OL,21,Fthe Queen, it's just amazing."
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
